  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You fill a space with burning smoke.</p><p>Choose a point within <strong>10 spaces. </strong>Each creature within a<strong> 5-space-radius</strong> of that point must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or become <strong>Stunned</strong> until the start of your next turn, as they descend into a coughing fit.</p><p>Each creature within the smoke can only see and target creatures that are adjacent to it. Creatures outside the smoke and at opposite ends of the cloud cannot see each other.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration of the smoke cloud and the <strong>Stunned</strong> condition by +<strong>1 rounds</strong>.</p>",
